#  M-1a: PrepareTurn Contract (Step 8 ??Backend-Orchestrated Turn Engine)
#
#  POST /prepare-turn 吏꾩엯?먯쓣 ?꾪븳 ?붿껌/?묐떟 怨꾩빟.
